"""Authored modality examples for the previously uncovered professional families.

Each case supplies concrete illustrative reasoning and a falsifiable incorrect
conclusion. These are synthetic teaching cases, not professional approval or
claims of execution. Canonical stable families select them without title inference.
"""

# Family -> (existing foundation, information-field -> (requirement, case discussion),
#            plausible wrong conclusion, reasoned disposition).
